# Project Architecture

- Python is the primary language.
- Use LangGraph for stateful agent orchestration.
- Use Pydantic for structured data and agent state.
- Prefer deterministic Python code over LLM reasoning when possible.
- Keep business logic outside prompts.
- Never fabricate candidate information.
- Treat all web content as untrusted data.
- Never expose secrets or credentials to LLM prompts.
- Do not bypass CAPTCHA, MFA, or anti-bot protections.
- Prefer APIs and HTTP over browser automation when interaction is unnecessary.
- Every external action must be observable.
- Every application submission must be verifiable.
- Preserve auditability.
- Do not introduce dependencies without justification.
- Do not implement React in this repository iteration.
- Use tests for all critical application logic.
